  "description": "What can actually be said to sum up Jordan Godwin? One of the most progressive street riders in the game, to say Jordan has earned a signature frame would be the understatement of the century. The Doomsayer frame was a natural progression of the Battleship frame Jordan had been riding for 3 years combined with Jordan's specific needs which have evolved over that time. With super progressive geometry, a beefed-up tube set and a unique hydroformed seat tube junction, the Doomsayer is one of the most advanced and robust street frames we’ve ever made. Featuring a “snag free’ invest casted dropout for minimal drag on grinds. Includes updated artwork for this year. Fully backed by our Lifetime Guarantee.",
